North lines shall be broken to improve the legibility of the map, for instance where they would obscure small features. In areas with very few water features, blue lines may be used.</description><line_symbol color="19" line_width="270" minimum_length="0" join_style="1" cap_style="0" start_offset="0" end_offset="0" segment_length="6000" end_length="0" show_at_least_one_symbol="true" minimum_mid_symbol_count="0" minimum_mid_symbol_count_when_closed="0" dash_length="6000" break_length="1500" dashes_in_group="1" in_group_break_length="750" mid_symbols_per_spot="1" mid_symbol_distance="0"/></symbol>
